Z||000022||Bugsy||08-18-2000||10:54 AM||||My baby has to sit outside in an unsecured parkinglot when i'm at work. I work at night so I installed an AutoPage brand system, its connected to its own siren as well as the horn, but being in a metal building full of machinery I wouldn't have been able to hear the alarm anyway so I also had the transmitter installed...it has a range of 3 miles so even in the metal building if the alarm is activated, it pages me. The additional benefits besides my own piece of mind is I now have keyless entry and keyless hatch release<P>------------------<BR>86 SE I'm addicted and proud of it<BR>Kevin||||reg||6
